{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2023-06-05 03:00:00', 'title': 'CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE AND USAID ANNOUNCE COLLABORATION TO SUPPORT UKRAINIAN FARMERS', 'text': 'COLLABORATION LEVERAGES STRENGTH OF THE U.S. PRIVATE SECTOR AND USAID TO ADVANCE UKRAINIAN AGRICULTURAL PRODUCTION AND EXPORTS INDIANAPOLIS , JUNE 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, CORTEVA, INC. (NYSE: CTVA) AND THE U.S. AGENCY FOR INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT (USAID) ANNOUNCED A NEW COLLABORATION TO SUPPORT UKRAINIAN FARMERS.\xa0THROUGH THIS COLLABORATION, USAID AND CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE WILL ADVANCE THE SHARED GOALS OF INCREASING FARMER ACCESS TO CROP INPUTS, FINANCING, AND POST-HARVEST STORAGE.'}